      "text": "It is with heavy hearts that we share the sudden and tragic loss of Marine Interdiction Agent and Course Instructor William Hutson from the Air and Marine Operations Academy.\n \nMIA Hutson devoted more than thirty years to federal service, beginning with the U.S. Coast Guard and continuing as a trusted leader and mentor in our community. His unwavering commitment to protecting our nation, saving lives, and fostering teamwork across agencies made a profound impact on all who had the privilege to work alongside him. William’s dedication to maritime operations, search and rescue, law enforcement, and vessel boardings was matched only by his compassion and integrity.\n \nWe extend our deepest condolences to his family, friends, and colleagues. William’s legacy of service, strength, and kindness will always be remembered. #NeverForgotten",
